<main id="top"><div class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-inner"><div><span class="tag">FOR RNs · NPs · APRNs</span><div class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:26px">A new chapter in your nursing career</div><h1>From bedside<br>to aesthetics.</h1><p>Botox Injector Bootcamp — certification coordination, training support, a starter kit, and business mentorship in one all-inclusive program.</p><div class="contact"><a class="btn light" href="#enroll">Start your journey</a><a class="btn" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #fff" href="#included">Explore the program</a></div></div>
<aside class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">All-inclusive tuition</div><div class="price">$1,494</div><p><b>One-time payment in full</b></p><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #ffffff55"><ul><li>AACM certification fees included</li><li>Training coordination</li><li>Injector starter kit</li><li>Business launch education</li><li>Lifetime business mentorship</li></ul><p style="font-size:12px">Certification is independently determined and issued by AACM. Enrollment subject to written program terms.</p></aside>
</div></div>
<section id="included"><div class="wrap"><div class="center"><div class="eyebrow">The program</div><h2>Everything you need to get started</h2><p class="muted">One clear tuition price. Coordinated support throughout your certification journey.</p></div><div class="cards">
<div class="card"><span class="num">01 / CERTIFICATION</span><h3>AACM certification coordination</h3><p>Umoya helps facilitate the enrollment and certification process. AACM independently determines eligibility and issues certificates.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="num">02 / TRAINING</span><h3>Training arrangements</h3><p>Guidance through scheduled learning and practical components, as applicable to the confirmed AACM program.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="num">03 / STARTER KIT</span><h3>Injector starter kit</h3><p>Starter materials included in the tuition. Exact kit contents will be listed in your enrollment agreement.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="num">04 / BUSINESS</span><h3>Launch essentials</h3><p>Learn about business structure, marketing, supplier research and considerations for starting an aesthetic practice.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="num">05 / OVERSIGHT</span><h3>Medical director guidance</h3><p>Understand medical oversight requirements and resources. Medical director placement or approval is not guaranteed.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="num">06 / MENTORSHIP</span><h3>Lifetime mentorship</h3><p>Ongoing business mentorship from Umoya, with scope and access terms specified at enrollment.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="tint" id="process"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Simple steps</div><h2>Your path into aesthetic nursing</h2><p>We help organize the moving pieces so you can focus on learning and planning your next career step.</p></div><div><ol class="list"><li><b>Apply and review eligibility.</b> Confirm your license and the program requirements.</li><li><b>Enroll with Umoya.</b> Review the written terms and pay the full tuition through Square.</li><li><b>Complete AACM requirements.</b> Umoya coordinates logistics; AACM controls certification decisions.</li><li><b>Build your business plan.</b> Use the included mentorship and launch education.</li></ol></div></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Meet your facilitator</div><h2>Guidance from a nurse entrepreneur</h2><h3>Cheryl Johnson, RN-BSN</h3><p>As the founder of Umoya Wellness Spa, Cheryl helps fellow nurses explore opportunities in aesthetics, navigate program logistics, and learn the business fundamentals behind a wellness practice.</p><p class="muted">Umoya's role is facilitation and business mentorship; AACM is the independent certification provider.</p></div><div class="pricebox"><div class="eyebrow">Program investment</div><h2>One all-inclusive price</h2><strong>$1,494</strong><p><b>Pay in full through Square</b></p><p>Includes AACM certification fees, coordinated training, starter kit, and the stated business support. No separate charge for those listed inclusions.</p><a class="btn" href="https://square.link/u/YgAW2BC7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pay securely with Square</a><p class="fine">Course dates vary and are arranged based on availability. Each student must find and bring their own eligible hands-on training model, subject to instructor approval and applicable consent and safety requirements. Model recruitment is not included in tuition. Eligibility, cancellation/refund provisions, and kit contents are confirmed in writing before payment.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="tint" id="faq"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px"><div class="center"><div class="eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</div><h2>Good to know</h2></div>
<details><summary>Who issues my certificate?</summary><p>AACM issues certificates directly to students who satisfy its eligibility and completion requirements. Umoya does not issue AACM certificates.</p></details>

<details><summary>Who do I pay?</summary><p>Students pay Umoya Wellness Spa as the program facilitator and payment administrator. The full program price is $1,494.</p></details>

<details><summary>Is everything included?</summary><p>The advertised tuition includes AACM certification fees, coordinated training, an injector starter kit, business education, and lifetime mentorship as defined in the written enrollment agreement.</p></details>

<details><summary>Does the certificate let me inject independently?</summary><p>No. A course certificate is not a professional license or independent authorization to inject. You must follow your state's scope-of-practice, prescribing, delegation, and supervision requirements.</p></details>

<details><summary>When is the next class?</summary><p>Course dates vary; contact Umoya to coordinate available dates before enrolling. Students are responsible for obtaining their own eligible hands-on training model. Models must meet training-provider screening and consent requirements.</p></details>
</div></section>

<section id="enroll"><div class="wrap center"><div class="eyebrow">Ready for your next chapter?</div><h2>Begin your Botox Injector Bootcamp journey</h2><p>Contact Umoya to review eligibility, variable course dates, the bring-your-own-model requirement, program documents, and full-payment checkout.</p><div class="contact" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn" href="https://square.link/u/YgAW2BC7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Enroll / Pay with Square</a><a class="btn" href="sms:3852829074?body=Hello%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20the%20Umoya%20Botox%20Injector%20Bootcamp.">Text 385-282-9074</a><a class="btn" href="mailto:umoyahelp@gmail.com?subject=Botox%20Injector%20Bootcamp%20Enrollment" style="background:#b89156">Email enrollment team</a></div><p class="fine" style="max-width:750px;margin:28px auto 0">AACM's name is used descriptively and does not imply AACM sponsorship or endorsement of Umoya.</p></div></section>
